{"4194980": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Dungeonfall", "steam_appid": 4194980, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dungeonfall</strong> is a fast-paced, retro-inspired action game that throws you straight into the fight. With crisp pixel art and intuitive controls, it delivers that classic dungeon-crawling rush—whether you're a genre veteran or dropping in for the first time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two Distinct Modes:</strong> Test your endurance in endless Survival, or brave the perilous depths of The Dungeon</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Permadeath:</strong> One life raises the stakes—every run counts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Loot &amp; Build:</strong> Collect weapons, armor, bombs, and potions; distribute stat points to craft your perfect build</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Global Leaderboards:</strong> Compete for high scores against players worldwide</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging Design:</strong> Navigate puzzles, traps, and relentless enemy waves</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play Your Way:</strong> Full controller and keyboard/mouse support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Perfect for Quick Sessions:</strong> Nostalgic pixel art and addictive &quot;just one more run&quot; gameplay</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dungeonfall is actively developed by a team that values player feedback. Jump in, die often, and help shape what's next.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dungeonfall</strong> is a fast-paced, retro-inspired action game that throws you straight into the fight. With crisp pixel art and intuitive controls, it delivers that classic dungeon-crawling rush—whether you're a genre veteran or dropping in for the first time.</p><p class=